Version 0.4.0
==============

Major update with extensive new features for creating atmospheric horror-themed visualizations.

NEW FEATURES:

* Added 22 new horror movie palettes:
  - TheExorcist, GetOut, Hereditary, TheWitch, ItFollows, Halloween, TheRing,
    Us, AQuietPlace, Carrie, Psycho, TheTexasChainsawMassacre, Alien, TheThing,
    Jaws, Poltergeist, TheOmen, Rosemary, Blair, Conjuring, Insidious, Sinister

* Added 10 mood-based palettes:
  - blood, ghostly, demonic, forestwitch, neonslasher, vintage, asylum, occult,
    nightmare, decay

* Added ggplot2 scale functions for easy integration:
  - scale_fill_horror() / scale_color_horror() - discrete scales
  - scale_fill_horror_c() / scale_color_horror_c() - continuous scales
  - scale_fill_horror_b() / scale_color_horror_b() - binned scales

* Added 9 ggplot2 theme functions:
  - theme_horror() - dark base theme with blood-red accents
  - theme_slasher() - high contrast 80s slasher style
  - theme_supernatural() - ethereal, ghostly appearance
  - theme_vintage() - old film sepia tones
  - theme_neon() - vibrant neon-noir horror
  - theme_asylum() - cold, clinical psychological horror
  - theme_occult() - dark purple and gold
  - theme_witch() - forest greens and earthy browns
  - theme_void_horror() - minimalist cosmic horror

* Added special effects functions:
  - blood_drips() - dripping blood effect from plot top
  - scratch_marks() - diagonal scratch marks overlay
  - vignette_effect() - darkened edges/corners
  - fog_effect() - misty fog atmosphere
  - glitch_effect() - digital glitch/corruption bars
  - static_effect() - TV static noise overlay
  - creepy_text() - horror-styled text annotations

* Added utility functions:
  - list_palettes() - view all available palettes by category
  - list_themes() - view all available themes with descriptions
  - list_effects() - view all available special effects
  - preview_palette() - visual preview of a palette
  - show_palettes() - display multiple palettes at once
  - horror_color() - get specific color from palette by index
  - creepify_color() - darken and desaturate any color
  - spooky_message() - random creepy messages for annotations

IMPROVEMENTS:

* Comprehensive documentation and examples in README
* Better organized codebase with separate files for scales, themes, and effects


